       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TTSTBLNN.
       AUTHOR.              C.I.HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        3/27/91.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      *D   TEST TBLOWUP WITH NO PROGRAM NAME PASSED.                   R
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYCSIS.
       01  BASE   PIC X(10).
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYCSIS.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
